WEBVTT

00:00.839 --> 00:03.839
[nautical music]
[航海音乐]

00:03.839 --> 00:11.973
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:14.773 --> 00:17.073
[rope creaking]
[绳索嘎吱作响]

00:17.073 --> 00:19.306
[suspenseful music]
[悬疑音乐]

00:23.139 --> 00:25.506
- Oh, look at
that cloud, Gary.
- 哦，看
那朵云，加里。

00:25.506 --> 00:28.706
It looks just like
a giraffe eating ice cream.
它看起来就像
一只长颈鹿在吃冰淇淋。

00:28.706 --> 00:30.739
- [meows]
- You're right, Gary.
- [喵]
- 你是对的，加里。

00:30.739 --> 00:32.073
All this cloud-watching...
所有这些云观看...

00:32.073 --> 00:33.439
[stomach grumbles]
is making me hungry too.
[肚子咕咕叫]
也让我饿了。

00:33.439 --> 00:36.206
Ooh!
Look at that big one, Gary.
哦！
看看那个大家伙，加里。

00:36.206 --> 00:38.439
And getting bigger
and bigger
并且越来越大
更大

00:38.439 --> 00:41.739
and bigger
and bigger and--ow!
更大
更大，而且——噢！

00:41.739 --> 00:43.806
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

00:43.806 --> 00:45.406
- [meow]
- [喵]

00:45.406 --> 00:48.073
[sniffing]
[嗅嗅]

00:48.073 --> 00:51.139
- Hey, Gary.
That was a pretty heavy cloud.
- 嘿，加里。
那是一片相当厚重的云。

00:51.139 --> 00:53.373
- [meows]
- You're right, Gary.
- [喵]
- 你是对的，加里。

00:53.373 --> 00:56.739
It's not a cloud at all.
[grunts]
这根本不是云。
[咕哝]

00:56.739 --> 00:58.573
Let's see what's inside.
让我们看看里面有什么。

00:58.573 --> 00:59.706
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

01:01.606 --> 01:03.573
Ooh, fortune cookies!
哦，幸运饼干！

01:03.573 --> 01:06.639
Vague prophecies baked into
delicious bite-sized snacks.
模糊的预言被融入
美味的一口大小的小吃。

01:06.639 --> 01:09.406
These cookies can
see the future, Gary,
这些cookies可以
看到未来，加里，

01:09.406 --> 01:13.906
which means they knew we were
hungry even before we did.
这意味着他们知道我们
甚至在我们之前就饿了。

01:13.906 --> 01:15.973
Let's eat!
Mmm!
我们吃饭吧！
嗯！

01:15.973 --> 01:19.806
[both eating noisily]
【两人吃饭吵闹】

01:19.806 --> 01:22.806
[reading]
[阅读]

01:22.806 --> 01:25.073
[gasps]
Did you hear that, Gary?
[喘气]
你听到了吗，加里？

01:25.073 --> 01:26.773
The fortune is true!
财运是真的！

01:26.773 --> 01:28.339
Let's look at your future.
让我们看看你的未来。

01:29.506 --> 01:33.106
"Happy trails
will follow you always."
“快乐的足迹
会永远跟随你。”

01:33.106 --> 01:36.139
[gasps]
Your fortune came true too!
[喘气]
你的财运也成真了！

01:36.139 --> 01:39.173
Cookies with fortunes
that actually come true?
带有财富的饼干
这真的实现了吗？

01:39.173 --> 01:41.373
We have to share
these with everybody!
我们必须分享
这些和大家一起！

01:43.073 --> 01:45.339
- No, SpongeBob,
we are not handing out
- 不，海绵宝宝，
我们不分发

01:45.339 --> 01:47.406
anything free
with every purchase.
任何免费的东西
每次购买。

01:47.406 --> 01:49.473
Even the smiles here
cost a nickel.
就连这里的笑容
花费五分钱。

01:49.473 --> 01:52.339
- Aw! Why not, Mr. Krabs?
- [laughs]
- 噢！为什么不呢，蟹老板？
- [笑]

01:52.339 --> 01:55.073
Because, SpongeBob,
fortune cookie fortunes
因为，海绵宝宝，
幸运饼干的命运

01:55.073 --> 01:58.606
are always lame
and they never come true.
总是蹩脚
但它们从未实现。

01:58.606 --> 02:01.173
- Oh, but that is where
you're wrong, Squidward.
- 哦，但那就是那里
你错了，章鱼哥。

02:01.173 --> 02:03.373
These fortune cookies
are different.
这些幸运饼干
是不同的。

02:03.373 --> 02:04.973
Try one.
尝试一个。

02:04.973 --> 02:06.973
- No.
- Oo-oop!
- 不。
- 噢噢！

02:06.973 --> 02:08.106
- Eh.
- 呃。

02:09.939 --> 02:11.373
[chewing]
[咀嚼]

02:13.073 --> 02:15.106
[sighs]
"You will be rewarded
[叹气]
“你将会得到回报

02:15.106 --> 02:18.506
for your particular talents."
Right.
为了你的特殊才能。”
对。

02:18.506 --> 02:20.206
- Excuse me,
Mr. Squidward Tentacles?
- 对不起，
章鱼哥先生的触手？

02:20.206 --> 02:21.639
You have just won
你刚刚赢了

02:21.639 --> 02:24.173
"The Most Miserable Cashier
In Bikini Bottom" contest.
《最惨的收银员》
在“比基尼泳裤”比赛中。

02:24.173 --> 02:26.939
Here's your cash prize.
Ha ha!
这是你的现金奖励。
哈哈！

02:26.939 --> 02:28.306
[tooooot]
[太呜呜]

02:28.306 --> 02:31.473
- Holy harpoons!
The fortune did come true!
- 圣鱼叉！
运气果然实现了！

02:31.473 --> 02:34.773
- Me cash register,
me money.
- 我的收银机，
我的钱。

02:34.773 --> 02:38.073
- And that's why my depression
is award-winning.
- 这就是我抑郁的原因
是屡获殊荣的。

02:38.073 --> 02:39.439
- Don't you see, Mr. Krabs?
- 你没看到吗，蟹老板？

02:39.439 --> 02:41.673
The fortunes in those cookies
are real!
那些饼干里的财富
是真的！

02:41.673 --> 02:43.273
Can't we share them
with everyone?
我们不能分享它们吗
和大家一起？

02:43.273 --> 02:44.806
- [gasps, coughs]
- [喘气，咳嗽]

02:44.806 --> 02:46.673
You know, you're right,
SpongeBob.
你知道，你是对的，
海绵宝宝。

02:46.673 --> 02:49.139
We must share these
magical macaroons
我们必须分享这些
神奇的杏仁饼

02:49.139 --> 02:51.706
with all the folks
in Bikini Bottom.
和所有的人
在比基尼底部。

02:51.706 --> 02:53.239
You just leave it to me.
你就交给我吧。

02:53.239 --> 02:54.939
- Oh, great!
- 哦，太棒了！

02:54.939 --> 02:57.473
- [sighs]
Great.
- [叹气]
太棒了。

03:00.339 --> 03:01.806
- This is how you hook 'em.
- 这就是你如何吸引他们。

03:01.806 --> 03:06.206
Now remember,
the first one is free!
现在记住，
第一个是免费的！

03:06.206 --> 03:09.073
[inhales, blows]
[吸气，吹气]

03:09.073 --> 03:12.439
[crowd talks excitedly]
[众人兴奋议论]

03:14.306 --> 03:15.839
- [chewing]
- [咀嚼]

03:15.839 --> 03:19.073
"Something wonderful
is about to happen to you".
“一些美妙的事情
即将发生在你身上”。

03:19.073 --> 03:20.906
[overlapping yipping]
[重叠的叫声]

03:20.906 --> 03:23.506
[laughs]
I love puppies!
[笑]
我喜欢小狗！

03:23.506 --> 03:25.273
Thanks, fortune cookie!
谢谢，幸运饼干！

03:25.273 --> 03:27.206
- Oh.
"Eat your hat,
- 哦。
“吃掉你的帽子，

03:27.206 --> 03:29.873
and you will
fall in love."
你会的
坠入爱河。”

03:29.873 --> 03:32.073
Ha ha.
[chewing]
哈哈。
[咀嚼]

03:32.073 --> 03:33.073
[gasps]
[喘气]

03:33.073 --> 03:35.306
- [chewing]
Hmm?
- [咀嚼]
嗯？

03:35.306 --> 03:37.239
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

03:37.239 --> 03:39.173
- [gulps]
Ah!
- [吞咽]
啊！

03:39.173 --> 03:40.606
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

03:40.606 --> 03:44.173
both: Thanks, fortune cookie.
两人：谢谢，幸运饼干。

03:45.306 --> 03:48.406
- "You will soon
injure your legs"?
- “你很快就会
伤到你的腿”？

03:50.473 --> 03:52.373
My legs!
我的腿！

03:52.373 --> 03:55.306
I was looking for an excuse
to get out of jury duty!
我一直在寻找借口
逃避陪审义务！

03:55.306 --> 03:58.073
[plays riff]
Thanks, fortune cookie!
[即兴演奏]
谢谢，幸运饼干！

03:58.073 --> 04:00.073
- Those fortune cookies
are a hit!
- 那些幸运饼干
很受欢迎！

04:00.073 --> 04:01.139
Whoa!
哇！

04:01.139 --> 04:04.273
[all talking at once]
[大家同时说话]

04:06.273 --> 04:09.206
- Fortune cookies
at the Krusty Krab, eh?
- 幸运饼干
在蟹堡王，是吧？

04:09.206 --> 04:11.939
Well, Eugene,
I have a prediction too:
嗯，尤金，
我也有一个预测：

04:11.939 --> 04:16.373
you are in for an epic fail
supreme with extra cheese.
你将会遭遇史诗般的失败
至高无上的额外奶酪。

04:16.373 --> 04:19.073
[laughs]
- Sheldon!
[笑]
- 谢尔顿！

04:19.073 --> 04:20.739
Where are you?
你在哪里？

04:20.739 --> 04:23.073
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

04:23.073 --> 04:24.706
[groans]
[呻吟]

04:24.706 --> 04:26.773
Barnacles, woman,
would it kill you
藤壶，女人，
它会杀了你吗

04:26.773 --> 04:28.373
to leave me alone
for five minutes?
让我一个人呆着
五分钟？

04:28.373 --> 04:29.906
- Sorry, your lordship,
- 对不起，陛下，

04:29.906 --> 04:33.239
but the garbage isn't
going to take itself out.
但垃圾不是
会自己出去。

04:33.239 --> 04:35.239
- Ugh!
[grunts]
- 呃！
[咕哝]

04:35.239 --> 04:37.306
Riddle me this,
computer wife:
给我谜语，
电脑老婆：

04:37.306 --> 04:38.839
What's hollow,
full of lies,
什么是空心的，
充满谎言，

04:38.839 --> 04:41.073
and leaves a bad taste
in your mouth?
并留下不好的味道
在你嘴里？

04:41.073 --> 04:42.839
- Our marriage?
- 我们的婚姻？

04:42.839 --> 04:45.339
- No! Fortune cookies!
- 不！幸运饼干！

04:45.339 --> 04:47.073
And Krabs is raking it
in right now
蟹老板正在掠夺它
现在

04:47.073 --> 04:50.306
because all of his fortunes
are actually coming true.
因为他所有的财富
正在真正实现。

04:50.306 --> 04:53.773
So...
- So, you've got an evil plan
所以...
- 所以，你有一个邪恶的计划

04:53.773 --> 04:55.806
to get the Krabby Patty
secret formula
去获取蟹黄饼
秘方

04:55.806 --> 04:57.373
and soon it will
be yours, all yours.
很快就会
是你的，全部都是你的。

04:57.373 --> 04:59.773
[as Plankton]
Wah-hah-hah-hah-hah-hah-hah!
[作为浮游生物]
哇哈哈哈哈哈哈！

04:59.773 --> 05:03.239
- Wow, I can't tell if
you're sarcastic or psychic.
- 哇，我不知道是否
你很讽刺或者通灵。

05:03.239 --> 05:04.639
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

05:06.839 --> 05:09.639
- [chuckling]
- [轻笑]

05:09.639 --> 05:11.139
Ooh, this'll be a good one.
哦，这将是一件好事。

05:11.139 --> 05:14.706
"You...stink."
“你……太臭了。”

05:14.706 --> 05:17.373
[laughs]
[笑]

05:18.273 --> 05:20.906
[continues laughing]
[继续笑]

05:20.906 --> 05:23.906
[suspenseful music]
[悬疑音乐]

05:23.906 --> 05:27.506
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

05:27.506 --> 05:30.139
Enjoy your new
fortune cookies, Krabs!
享受你的新
幸运饼干，蟹蟹！

05:30.139 --> 05:32.573
- * La la
la-la-la-la-la-la *
- *啦啦
啦啦啦啦啦啦啦*

05:32.573 --> 05:34.773
Time for a refill!
是时候补充一下了！

05:34.773 --> 05:37.906
[crowd all talking excitedly]
[众人兴奋地议论]

05:42.073 --> 05:43.406
- What is my future?
- 我的未来是什么？

05:43.406 --> 05:44.973
- My tentacles
are gonna fall off
- 我的触手
会掉下来

05:44.973 --> 05:47.306
if I don't get
a break soon, Mr. Krabs!
如果我没有得到
快休息一下吧，蟹老板！

05:47.306 --> 05:48.873
- Look out, Mr. Squidward.
- 小心，章鱼哥先生。

05:48.873 --> 05:51.606
I'll teach you how
to run a cash register.
我会教你如何
运行收银机。

05:51.606 --> 05:53.139
[cracks knuckles]
[指关节嘎吱作响]

05:53.139 --> 05:56.506
[nautical music speeds up]
[航海音乐加快]

05:56.506 --> 05:58.906
Huh?
More cookies, SpongeBob!
啊？
更多饼干，海绵宝宝！

05:58.906 --> 06:01.373
- Fortunes flying in,
Mr. Krabs!
- 财富飞来，
蟹老板！

06:01.373 --> 06:05.239
- Let the wave
of misfortune begin!
- 让波浪
不幸的开始了！

06:05.239 --> 06:08.573
- "You will get stomach cramps
from the Krusty Krab"?
- “你会胃痉挛
来自蟹堡王”？

06:08.573 --> 06:13.073
- "An octopus with a big nose
just spit in your food"?
- “一只大鼻子的章鱼
只是吐在你的食物里”？

06:13.073 --> 06:15.806
[melodramatic accent chords]
[戏剧性的重音和弦]

06:15.806 --> 06:17.173
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

06:17.173 --> 06:21.706
- "A yellow sponge will
serve you salmonella"?
- “黄色海绵会
为您服务沙门氏菌”？

06:21.706 --> 06:25.773
- "You will live forever if
you eat at the Chum Bucket"?
- “如果你会永远活着
你在 Chum Bucket 吃饭吗？

06:25.773 --> 06:28.439
- Let's eat at
the Chum Bucket!
- 我们去吃饭吧
密友桶！

06:28.439 --> 06:31.906
[all cheering]
[大家欢呼]

06:31.906 --> 06:33.506
- [whimpering]
- [呜咽]

06:41.073 --> 06:43.673
[crowd talking excitedly]
[人群兴奋地议论]

06:43.673 --> 06:45.806
- What did we ever do
to those fortune cookies
- 我们曾经做过什么
那些幸运饼干

06:45.806 --> 06:48.073
to make them lie
about us like that?
让他们撒谎
关于我们这样吗？

06:48.073 --> 06:49.506
- Well, the fortunes
in those cookies
- 好吧，命运
在那些饼干里

06:49.506 --> 06:51.706
were always right before.
以前总是对的。

06:51.706 --> 06:54.406
Here, Mr. Krabs--maybe this next
one'll change your luck.
在这里，蟹老板——也许是下一个
一个人会改变你的运气。

06:54.406 --> 06:56.406
- [grumbling]
- [抱怨]

06:56.406 --> 06:58.806
Hmm. "Unless you
give a tiny copepod
唔。 “除非你
给一个小小的桡足类动物

06:58.806 --> 07:02.139
"the Krabby Patty
secret formula,
“蟹肉饼
秘密配方，

07:02.139 --> 07:03.673
you will die"?
你会死”？

07:03.673 --> 07:08.073
- Hello!
Did someone say "copepod"?
- 你好！
有人说“桡足类”吗？

07:08.073 --> 07:10.106
[both screaming in panic]
[两人惊慌地尖叫]

07:15.473 --> 07:18.106
Just wanted to borrow
a cup of grease, Eugene.
只是想借
一杯油脂，尤金。

07:18.106 --> 07:20.873
I'll come back later!
Ciao!
我以后会回来的！
再见！

07:20.873 --> 07:24.306
- J-just how true are these
cookie fortunes, SpongeBob?
- J-这些到底有多真实
饼干财富，海绵宝宝？

07:24.306 --> 07:27.973
- If the cookie says
it's true, then it's true!
- 如果cookie说
这是真的，那就是真的！

07:27.973 --> 07:32.306
Horribly, terribly,
truthfully true!
可怕的是，可怕的是，
说实话！

07:32.306 --> 07:36.439
[weeping loudly]
[大声哭泣]

07:38.373 --> 07:39.873
- "You will die."
- “你会死的。”

07:39.873 --> 07:43.239
[voice echoing]
Die...die...die...
[声音回响]
死……死……死……

07:43.239 --> 07:44.973
- [crying]
- [哭泣]

07:44.973 --> 07:49.573
- Oh, I'll miss you, Daddy!
[sobs]
- 噢，我会想念你的，爸爸！
[抽泣]

07:49.573 --> 07:50.839
But I really can't
wait to spend
但我真的不能
等待花费

07:50.839 --> 07:53.539
all your hard-earned
money on shoes!
你辛苦赚来的一切
钱买鞋！

07:53.539 --> 07:54.673
- Me money!
- 我的钱！

07:54.673 --> 07:59.873
- Mr. Krabs, no!
[wailing loudly]
- 蟹老板先生，不！
[大声哀嚎]

07:59.873 --> 08:01.906
- [grunts]
- [wailing]
- [咕哝]
- [哀号]

08:01.906 --> 08:05.139
[distantly]
Mr. Krabs?
[远处]
蟹老板？

08:05.139 --> 08:07.806
Mr. Krabs, it's time.
蟹老板，时间到了。

08:07.806 --> 08:09.773
- Aah-ha-ha!
- It's time to give up
- 啊哈哈哈！
- 是时候放弃了

08:09.773 --> 08:11.673
the secret formula
to Plankton.
秘密公式
到浮游生物。

08:11.673 --> 08:13.139
Because your life
is worth more
因为你的生活
更有价值

08:13.139 --> 08:15.873
than some scrap
of paper in a bottle!
比一些废料
瓶子里有纸！

08:15.873 --> 08:17.873
- You're right, me boy-o.
- 你是对的，我的孩子。

08:17.873 --> 08:20.906
I got to face me fortune.
我必须面对我的命运。

08:22.739 --> 08:25.106
- Don't crowd,
there's more chumbalaya
- 不要拥挤，
还有更多的 chumbalaya

08:25.106 --> 08:27.906
where that came from,
unfortunately.
那是从哪里来的，
不幸的是。

08:27.906 --> 08:29.939
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

08:29.939 --> 08:32.339
[all chewing]
[全部咀嚼]

08:32.339 --> 08:33.473
all: Ugh!
全体：呃！

08:33.473 --> 08:35.373
- It's worth it
to live forever.
- 这是值得的
永远活下去。

08:35.373 --> 08:38.339
- This scheme is working
perfectly.
- 这个计划正在发挥作用
完美。

08:38.339 --> 08:41.073
And here comes
gullible Krabs now
来了
现在的蟹蟹很容易上当受骗

08:41.073 --> 08:43.706
to hand-deliver
the secret formula.
亲手交付
秘密公式。

08:43.706 --> 08:45.973
I promised
myself I wouldn't cry.
我答应过
我自己不会哭。

08:45.973 --> 08:46.906
[laughs]
[笑]

08:50.339 --> 08:53.539
- Oh, this crowd
is impossible!
- 哦，这群人
是不可能的！

08:53.539 --> 08:55.139
- Leave it to me,
Mr. Krabs!
- 交给我吧
蟹老板！

08:55.139 --> 09:00.239
I'll make sure Plankton
gets his so you won't get yours.
我会确保浮游生物
得到他的，所以你不会得到你的。

09:00.239 --> 09:02.806
Hot stuff comin' through!
热门内容来了！

09:02.806 --> 09:04.306
[grunts]
[咕哝]

09:04.306 --> 09:07.273
[grunting noisily]
[大声咕哝]

09:07.273 --> 09:08.873
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

09:08.873 --> 09:12.539
- Don't worry, secret formula!
I'm coming, baby!
- 别担心，秘密配方！
我来了，宝贝！

09:14.206 --> 09:19.673
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

09:19.673 --> 09:21.439
- Yow! Ow!
- 哟！噢！

09:21.439 --> 09:23.206
- [struggling]
- [挣扎]

09:24.706 --> 09:29.206
- [gasping excitedly]
- [兴奋地喘气]

09:29.206 --> 09:31.839
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

09:31.839 --> 09:34.539
Me wants that ba-ba!
我想要那个爸爸！

09:34.539 --> 09:36.073
- Aah!
- 啊啊！

09:38.873 --> 09:42.406
- Here, Plankton. Mr. Krabs
wants you to have this.
- 在这里，浮游生物。蟹老板先生
希望你拥有这个。

09:42.406 --> 09:45.139
- Heh, heh!
Finally!
- 嘿嘿！
最后！

09:45.139 --> 09:46.906
[straining]
[紧张]

09:46.906 --> 09:48.306
No!
不！

09:48.306 --> 09:51.073
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

09:51.073 --> 09:52.373
Whoa--[grunts]
哇——[咕哝]

09:52.373 --> 09:55.573
Aah, aah!
啊啊啊！

09:55.573 --> 09:58.106
[screams]
[尖叫声]

09:58.106 --> 10:00.639
I have had enough!
我已经受够了！

10:02.306 --> 10:05.839
Get out of my restaurant,
you mindless sheep!
滚出我的餐厅
你这没脑子的羊！

10:05.839 --> 10:07.306
I wrote those fortunes!
这些算命都是我写的！

10:07.306 --> 10:08.706
[all gasp]
They were fakes!
[全都喘气]
他们是假货！

10:08.706 --> 10:11.873
Don't you get it?
Now all of you, out!
你不明白吗？
现在你们都出去！

10:11.873 --> 10:12.973
[growls]
[咆哮]

10:12.973 --> 10:15.173
- Let's go back to
the Krusty Krab!
- 让我们回到
蟹堡王！

10:15.173 --> 10:18.106
all: Yeah!
- Yeah, back to the Krusty Krab!
全体：是啊！
- 是的，回到蟹堡王！

10:18.106 --> 10:20.839
all: Yeah!
全体：是啊！

10:20.839 --> 10:23.373
- Hmm hmm.
- [sighs]
- 嗯嗯。
- [叹气]

10:23.373 --> 10:26.073
- I guess I didn't really
think that through.
- 我想我真的没有
想通了。

10:26.073 --> 10:29.473
- I figured the funeral fortune
was phony, Flankton!
- 我计算了葬礼的财富
是假的，弗兰克顿！

10:29.473 --> 10:30.673
- Oh, yeah?
- 哦，是吗？

10:30.673 --> 10:33.573
What are you
gonna do about it, Eugene?
你是什么
尤金，你会怎么做？

10:33.573 --> 10:34.973
- Nothing, Sheldon.
- 没什么，谢尔顿。

10:34.973 --> 10:37.673
Here, have a fortune cookie.
来，吃一块幸运饼干。

10:37.673 --> 10:38.973
- [grunts]
Huh.
- [咕哝]
呵呵。

10:38.973 --> 10:41.706
"You will go on a long voyage
“你将踏上长途航行

10:41.706 --> 10:45.173
where you will get
everything you deserve."
你会得到什么
一切都是你应得的。”

10:45.173 --> 10:46.306
Hey!
嘿！

10:50.073 --> 10:51.073
[grunts]
[咕哝]

10:51.073 --> 10:53.806
Uhh! Hey! Oof!
呃！嘿！钱币！

10:53.806 --> 10:55.773
Mommy!
- [chomp]
妈妈！
- [咀嚼]

10:57.839 --> 11:01.073
[ukulele music]
[尤克里里音乐]

11:01.073 --> 11:08.973
*
*
*
*

*